  triage:title "AI.14 Mac↔Mac physical peer-pair evidence not yet collected" ;
  triage:description "docs/plans/phase-ai/sprint-ai-14-mac-peer-smoke.md remains status: proposed with no attached readiness-record evidence artifact. Closure requires two physical macOS daemon hosts to pass every AI.13 peer-pair case (bidirectional send/read/nudge/ack, exact-ULID replay, unavailable-peer, failed-remote-ack, bad-certificate, non-allowlisted-peer) on the merged release candidate, with atm doctor --json, sanitized daemon logs, and just lint && just test captured at the tested commit. No code fix closes this — it is a physical-execution gap only. All AI.16-AI.20 local/code-level findings are independently closed and merged; this is the sole remaining item for AI.14 per the project rule that local findings close before cross-host evidence work begins." ;
